{"title":"治理 - Rust 程序设计语言","description":"一门帮助每个人构建可靠且高效软件的语言。","html":"<header class=\"mt3 mt2-ns mb4 mb5-ns tc tl-ns\">\n  <div class=\"w-100 mw-none ph3 mw8-m mw9-l center f3\">\n    <h1>治理</h1>\n    <h2 class=\"f2 f1-ns mt0\">社区如何构筑 Rust</h2>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<section id=\"roadmap\" class=\"red\">\n  <div class=\"w-100 mw-none ph3 mw8-m mw9-l center f3\">\n    <header>\n      <h2>路线图和 RFC 流程</h2>\n      <div class=\"highlight\"></div>\n    </header>\n    <div class=\"flex flex-column flex-row-l\">\n      <div class=\"mw8 flex flex-column justify-between pt0 bp2 pv3-ns ph3-l\">\n        <p>Rust 中的每个重要决定都是从征求意见稿（RFC）开始的。\n任何人都可以参与提案的讨论，权衡利弊以便达成共识。\n虽然有时会很艰难，但社区这种深思熟虑正是保证 Rust 高质量的秘诀。</p>\n        <a\n          href=\"https://github.com/rust-lang/rfcs\"\n          class=\"button button-secondary\"\n          >了解更多</a\n        >\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"teams\" class=\"purple\">\n  <div class=\"w-100 mw-none ph3 mw-8-m mw9-l center f3\">\n    <header>\n      <h2>团队</h2>\n      <div class=\"highlight\"></div>\n    </header>\n    <div class=\"flex flex-column flex-row-l flex-wrap-l justify-start tc\">\n      <div class=\"flex flex-column justify-between w-100 w-33-l mb4 pa3\">\n          <h3>领导议会</h3>\n          <p>负责整个 Rust 项目的成功，由顶级团队的代表组成</p>\n          <a href=\"/governance/teams/leadership-council\" class=\"center w-100 mw6 button button-secondary\">\n              成员和联系方式\n          </a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex flex-column justify-between w-100 w-33-l mb4 pa3\">\n          <h3>编译器团队</h3>\n          <p>编译器内部结构和优化</p>\n          <a href=\"/governance/teams/compiler\" class=\"center w-100 mw6 button button-secondary\">\n              成员和联系方式\n          </a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex flex-column justify-between w-100 w-33-l mb4 pa3\">\n          <h3>开发工具团队</h3>\n          <p>Rust 开发者工具</p>\n          <a href=\"/governance/teams/dev-tools\" class=\"center w-100 mw6 button button-secondary\">\n              成员和联系方式\n          </a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex flex-column justify-between w-100 w-33-l mb4 pa3\">\n          <h3>基础架构团队</h3>\n          <p>Rust 项目自身所需的各种基础设施：持续集成、版本管理、机器人和性能指标。</p>\n          <a href=\"/governance/teams/infra\" class=\"center w-100 mw6 button button-secondary\">\n              成员和联系方式\n          </a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex flex-column justify-between w-100 w-33-l mb4 pa3\">\n          <h3>语言团队</h3>\n          <p>设计新的语言特性</p>\n          <a href=\"/governance/teams/lang\" class=\"center w-100 mw6 button button-secondary\">\n              成员和联系方式\n          </a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex flex-column justify-between w-100 w-33-l mb4 pa3\">\n          <h3>Launching pad</h3>\n          <p>团队的临时家园</p>\n          <a href=\"/governance/teams/launching-pad\" class=\"center w-100 mw6 button button-secondary\">\n              成员和联系方式\n          </a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex flex-column justify-between w-100 w-33-l mb4 pa3\">\n          <h3>库团队</h3>\n          <p>Rust 标准库、rust-lang 包、代码约定以及生态的支持。</p>\n          <a href=\"/governance/teams/library\" class=\"center w-100 mw6 button button-secondary\">\n              成员和联系方式\n          </a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex flex-column justify-between w-100 w-33-l mb4 pa3\">\n          <h3>审查团队</h3>\n          <p>帮助维护行为准则</p>\n          <a href=\"/governance/teams/moderation\" class=\"center w-100 mw6 button button-secondary\">\n              成员和联系方式\n          </a>\n      </div>\n</div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"teams-and-members\" class=\"green\">\n  <div class=\"w-100 mw-none ph3 mw-8-m mw9-l center f3\">\n    <header>\n      <h2>Teams and Members</h2>\n      <div class=\"highlight\"></div>\n    </header>\n    <div class=\"mb4\">\n      The Rust project is composed of many teams, and developed by many contributors.\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"flex flex-column flex-row-l justify-start w-full mt2\">\n      <a\n        href=\"/governance/teams\"\n        class=\"center w-100 mw6 button button-secondary mt2\"\n      >\n        Show all teams\n      </a>\n      <a\n        href=\"/governance/people\"\n        class=\"center w-100 mw6 button button-secondary mt2\"\n      >\n        Show all team members\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"}